Project Documentation Phase
EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

Project Documentation Phase

1. Introduction

EduGenie is an AI-powered learning assistant designed to help students learn more effectively. It uses Google Gemini to provide explanations, answer questions, summarize topics, generate study materials, and support students with their academic work.

The documentation phase records all important information about the project, including its objectives, requirements, design, development, testing, and future improvements.

2. Objectives

To develop an intelligent learning assistant for students.

To provide quick and understandable answers to academic questions.

To simplify difficult concepts using AI-generated explanations.

To generate summaries and study materials.

To provide an interactive and user-friendly learning experience.

To reduce the time required to search for educational information.


