5. Main Features

1. AI Chat Assistant – Students can ask academic questions.


2. Concept Explanation – Explains difficult topics in simple language.


3. Summarization – Converts lengthy content into short notes.


4. Question Answering – Provides answers to educational queries.


5. Study Material Generation – Creates notes and learning content.


6. Interactive Learning – Allows students to interact with the AI assistant.


7. User-Friendly Interface – Simple interface suitable for students.



6. System Workflow

Student → EduGenie Interface → Backend → Gemini API → AI Processing → Response → Student

The student enters a question through the EduGenie interface. The backend sends the request to the Gemini API. Gemini processes the question and generates a response, which is then displayed to the student.

