8. Testing Documentation

The system is tested to verify that:

The application loads correctly.

User questions are received properly.

Gemini API requests work correctly.

Relevant responses are displayed.

Invalid or empty inputs are handled.

The interface works correctly on different screen sizes.

Errors are handled without crashing the application.


