13. Conclusion

EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant demonstrates how generative AI can be used to improve the learning experience. The project provides students with an interactive platform for asking questions, understanding concepts, creating study materials, and learning efficiently. Proper documentation ensures that the system's requirements, development process, testing results, and future scope are clearly recorded for maintenance and further development.
